# 🚩 RedFlag.AI — Job Posting Analyzer

> **Day 14 of 60-Day Cloud AI Challenge**

An AI-powered tool that analyzes job descriptions and company info to detect red flags before you apply.

## ✨ Features

- 🎯 **Risk Score 0–100** — color-coded (green / amber / red)
- 🚩 **Top Red Flags** — each with severity rating (1–10)
- ✅ **Positive Signals** detection
- 📊 **Risk Breakdown** — animated bars across 5 categories
- 💬 **5 Smart Interview Questions** auto-generated
- ✅ / ⚠️ / ❌ **Final Verdict** — Apply / Caution / Avoid

## 🛠️ Built With

- Claude AI API (claude-sonnet-4-6)
- Vanilla JavaScript
- HTML5 + CSS3
- Single file — zero backend, zero dependencies

## 🚀 How to Use

1. Open `ai-red-flag-detector.html` in any browser
2. Paste job description + company info
3. Click **Analyze for Red Flags**
4. Get instant AI-powered risk analysis

